---
title: Pumpkin Pie
source: https://foodwishes.blogspot.com/2012/11/best-pumpkin-pie-ever-come-for-pie-stay.html
author: FoodWishes
tags: [dessert]
cuisine: American
---

Pre-heat the oven to !425F.

Whisk together @pumpkin puree{15 oz}, @eggs{2}, and @condensed milk{14 oz} until smooth.

Add @cinnamon{1 tsp}, @ginger{1/2 tsp}, @nutmet{1/4 tsp}, @ground pepper{1/8 tsp}, and @salt{1/2 tsp} and whisk until combined.

Line a #pie pan{} with @./puff-pastry{1 sheet} and crimp the edges. Pour the pumpkin mixture into the crust.

Bake for ~{15 minutes}. Reduce the oven temperature to !350F and bake for an additional ~{30 minutes} or until a knife inserted in the center comes out clean.